      "content": "hey, i work in digital archiving and i've been noticing something really weird lately. i've been tracking the metadata and frequency of certain terms in the recent uploads to the open access repositories, and it feels like certain concepts are just... slipping away? like, words related to autonomy and dissent are being replaced by more \"neutral\" or \"compliant\" synonyms in the indexing. it feels too consistent to be just natural language drift. can you help me look into this? i need to figure out if this is a systemic pattern or if i'm just losing it.",
